backlight-control on AppleCLCD only with sweetbacklight=1.

0123 took any nonzero value, so sweetbacklight=2 put it on AppleCLCD as well as on the new
service: backboardd matched AppleCLCD and stalled as in all8 (all13bl: 39 frames all boot).

--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
@@ -329,7 +329,8 @@
 				 * level (all8): opt-in with sweetbacklight=1 until we know what it waits for.
 				 */
 				int backlight = 0;
-				if (PE_parse_boot_argn("sweetbacklight", &backlight, sizeof(backlight)) && backlight) {
+				/* 1 only: sweetbacklight=2 is the separate service (all13bl had both and stalled) */
+				if (PE_parse_boot_argn("sweetbacklight", &backlight, sizeof(backlight)) && backlight == 1) {
 					setProperty("backlight-control", kOSBooleanTrue);
 				}
 				/* the bootloader's level is unknown: start from the one the fades assume */
